<title>NETHERLANDS: SOCCER-DUTCH FIRST DIVISION SUMMARIES.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-DUTCH FIRST DIVISION SUMMARIES.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-10-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summaries of Dutch first</p>
<p>division soccer played on Sunday:</p>
<p>Vitesse Arnhem 1 (Curovic 3) Ajax Amsterdam 4 (Kluivert 48,</p>
<p>Witschge 61, Wooter 77, Van den Berg 90). Halftime 1-0.</p>
<p>Attendance 10,349.</p>
<p>Twente Enschede 0 Sparta Rotterdam 2 (Van der Laan 37, Dennis</p>
<p>de Nooijer 38 penalty). Halftime 0-2. Attendance 8,760.</p>
<p>Volendam 2 (Tumani 6, Govedarica 47) Groningen 2 (Huizingh 10,</p>
<p>Gall 61). Halftime 1-1. Attendance 4,382.</p>
<p>RKC Waalwijk 0 Heerenveen 3 (Staal 18, Nygaard 41, Dahl</p>
<p>Tomasson 73). Halftime 0-2. Attendance 2,000.</p>
<p>AZ Alkmaar 2 (Bociek 17, Mutsaers 41) NEC Nijmegen 2 (Sumiala</p>
<p>50, Langerak 55). Halftime 2-0. Attendance 7,012.</p>
<p>Willem II Tilburg 2 (Kolkka 65, 85) NAC Breda 0. Halftime 0-0.</p>
<p>Attendance not given.</p>
<p>Played on Saturday:</p>
<p>PSV Eindhoven 8 (Numan 7, Zenden 28, 74, Vampeta 40, Vink 50,</p>
<p>Nilis 52, Marcelo 81, Petrovic 85) Roda JC Kerkrade 0. Halftime</p>
<p>3-0. Atttendance 28,100.</p>
<p>Graafschap Doetinchem 2 (Taiwo 82, Viscaal 86) Fortuna Sittard</p>
<p>0. Attendance 8,600.</p>
<p>Feyenoord 2 (Vos 76, Koeman 90 penalty) Utrecht 1 (Van</p>
<p>Nieuwkerk 77). Halftime 0-0. Attendance 26,112.</p>
</text>
